    "N19 floor and seating checks passed on the first geometry build; retained generous aisles and authored native fitting before proof rendering.",
    "N18 independent QA added subpixel route sampling and all-floor return paths; N20 validates interpolated <=0.5px body positions and exact fitted floor endpoints.",
